    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730-a8">

                <pb facs="1322" n="1198" xml:id="pg1198"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 8 in No. 287.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker to Mr. Saavedra.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-11-01"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 1,
                        1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: Referring to your excellency’s two
                    notes to me, both of date the 9th ultimo, to my note to your excellency of date
                    the 14th ultimo, to your excellency’s note to me of date the 18th ultimo,
                    together with its inclosure bearing date the 19th ultimo, to my note to your
                    excellency of date the 21st ultimo, and to your excellency’s note to me of date
                    the 24th ultimo, I have the honor to assure your excellency that I shall, by the
                    earliest opportunity and in a proper manner, bring the subjects of this
                    correspondence to the knowledge and consideration of my government.</p>
                <p>I avail myself, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JEHU BAKER.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
